## Installation

Refer to [Sinerr kubernetes documentation](https://docs.sinerr.dev/getting-started/kubernetes)

## Update Notes

### Updating to 3.0.0

Nothing has changed; we just rebranded the `jellyseerr` Helm chart to `sinerr` 🥳 refer to our [Migration guide](https://docs.sinerr.dev/migration-guide).

### Updating to 2.7.0

Sinerr is a stateful application and it is not designed to have multiple replicas. In version 2.7.0 we address this by:

- replacing `Deployment` with `StatefulSet`
- removing `replicaCount` value

If `replicaCount` value was used - remove it. Helm update should work fine after that.

